Select the native bridge at early-init so an optional boot entry can test Google's
included Berberis translator. The normal entry keeps Houdini. Google's existing init
hooks select the matching ARM64 libraries and executable handlers.
Drop when Google's default translator works on this laptop without comparison tests.

--- a/system/build.prop
